d2full 0014: UI rects for the page's menu/HUD scaler. Once the world is composed (render_ingame, after the widescreen copy) d2web::ui_begin() opens a UI window; blit_sprite and Font::draw_tinted (plus tooltip / chat boxes, and the world labels' boxes via ui_add_abs) record their bounding rects into d2web's recorder until Town::draw ends it (ui_end); d2web::present merges them (<= 64) and sends them with the screen id (menu / in game / video, ui_screen at both present sites of main.cpp) as a trailer of the frame buffer. Town::draw shifts the rects by the widescreen offset (ui_offset).

